      "summary": "Initial release, built by the agent team against the official Claude Certified Developer – Foundations Exam Guide v1.0 (effective July 2026). 8 domains with the official weights and all 25 skills as lessons (titles verbatim) in the lessons format, with worked Python and configuration examples and one worked-example diagram per lesson. 249 single-answer questions (22% hard) allocated by skill weight with at least 6 per skill, and 6 case studies that reach all 25 skills. Product facts come from the live Claude documentation as read on 2 November 2026. Known limit: the real exam also has multiple-response items, which SkillUp's practice mode does not support yet."
    }
